[
  {
    "entryID": 0,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（第三個早晨。馬車還得等二十來天，你正打盹，蕭靈犀卻在數桌上僅剩的銅板。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      1
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 1,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「二十七、二十八、二十九……唉，交了三百錢房租，就剩這點了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      2
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 2,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「還夠用吧？有床睡、有飯吃，比睡野地強多了。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      3
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 3,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「表哥！雲中物價貴得很，英豪府遴選又要置辦行頭——咱們現在是坐吃山空！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=2);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      4
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 4,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「那不然呢？去跟大公雞再鬥三回合？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=6);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      5
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 5,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「鬥雞能賺幾個錢？山賊把路一封，村裡沒市集，過路客也進不來——人家要在客棧開個[em2]小棧[/em2]，誰有貨托過手、誰想買就來翻，賣了再分帳。這才是通路商的第一步！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Idea);",
    "links": [
      6
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 6,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（她撕下點蛙簿空白頁折成小帳冊，拉著你出門。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      7
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 7,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（村口茶攤。茶博士正撥著算盤。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      8
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 8,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「子曰：君子固窮……可老子不想固窮啊。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      9
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 9,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「茶博士，您上回帳本裡不是寫著——[em2]有錢自遠方來，才亦樂乎[/em2]？現在遠方的人有錢也過不來啦。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      10
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 10,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「小丫頭，記性倒好。怎麼，你們兄妹無事不登三寶殿，今天怎來我這啦？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      11
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 11,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「嘻嘻，讓您見笑啦。小犀在客棧開小棧做買賣——誰有貨托咱們過手標價，有人買就賣，賣了跟您分帳。您茶攤見的人多，有沒有願意試試的？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      12
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 12,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「做買賣？你這小丫頭，算盤打得倒快。茶葉管夠，壓箱底的玩意兒，免談。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      13
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 13,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「又不是白拿。小犀幫您標價、記帳，賣了分您九成……再說，櫃底那個沾灰的盒子，放著也是放著吧？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      14
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 14,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);BeginDiceRoll(Auto,InsightCheck,4);",
    "links": [
      15
    ],
    "Description": "自動洞悉檢定觸發點 (難度4)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 15,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      16,
      17
    ],
    "Description": "自動檢定後的空緩衝節點"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 16,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你瞧見茶博士目光往櫃底一閃，指尖在算盤上停了半拍——那盒子，他並非當真忘了。[即時訊息區]: 洞悉檢定成功！洞悉經驗+10。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == true;ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Insight,10);",
    "links": [
      18
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 17,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（茶博士撥算盤的聲音依舊平穩，你也說不清他到底在不在意那個盒子。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      18
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 18,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「……眼睛倒是尖。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      19,
      20,
      21
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 19,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "[em2][口才檢定][/em2]「茶博士，小犀年紀小，說話直了些，您別見怪。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      22
    ],
    "Description": "選項1：口才檢定 (難度6)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 20,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「九一分帳，說定了便一銅板不少。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      27
    ],
    "Description": "選項2：信義"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 21,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「先試一試，賣不出再收回便是。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      29
    ],
    "Description": "選項3：通達"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 22,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "BeginDiceRoll(Manual,PersuasionCheck,6);",
    "links": [
      23
    ],
    "Description": "口才檢定擲骰節點 (難度6)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 23,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「茶博士，小犀年紀小，說話直了些。托您過手的貨，她記帳比誰都清楚，您就讓她試一試嘛。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      24,
      25
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 24,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「……成，就讓妳試試。」",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == true;DisableCharacterExpression(0);ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Persuasion,10);",
    "links": [
      31
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 25,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「茶博士，小犀她……呃……」",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == false;SetPortrait(MC1,pic=7);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Nervous);",
    "links": [
      26
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 26,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「結巴什麼？……罷了，看在小丫頭記性好的份上，讓她試試。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);",
    "links": [
      31
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 27,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「九一分帳，說定了便一銅板不少。茶博士的貨，小犀絕不短您分文。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      28
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 28,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「哼，口氣倒硬。……成，讓妳試試。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);",
    "links": [
      31
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 29,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「先試一試嘛，賣不出再收回，茶博士您又不損什麼。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      30
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 30,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「……你們這些小鬼頭。成，試試就試試。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);",
    "links": [
      31
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 31,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（茶博士嘆口氣，蹲到櫃底，摸出一只[em2]雀羽面具[/em2]，羽毛尚帶光澤，卻沾了層薄灰。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      32
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 32,
    "actorID": "role105",
    "text": "[panel=1]「這玩意兒跟了我些年，就放你那過手，標個價，賣了九一分——我九，你一。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      33
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 33,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「入帳！小犀記下了！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Surprise_2);",
    "links": [
      34
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 34,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（村東小屋。滿臉橫肉的書生抱著竹簡發呆。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      35
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 35,
    "actorID": "NPC4",
    "text": "「子曰……唉，子曰了半天，[em2]《孝經》[/em2]、[em2]《論語》[/em2]攢了一摞，過路書商不來，這書難道當柴燒？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      36
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 36,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「書生哥哥，托幾本在客棧試試嘛。有人買，小犀記帳分您；沒人買，再搬回來就是。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      37
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 37,
    "actorID": "NPC4",
    "text": "「……你看得懂這些？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      38
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 38,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「看不懂，可總有人要。放小棧，比堆在這兒發霉強。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      39
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 39,
    "actorID": "NPC4",
    "text": "「……也罷，拿兩本去。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      40
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 40,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（村中空地。郎中正曬藥材。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      41
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 41,
    "actorID": "role113",
    "text": "「雲遊的人，走哪兒都撿點東西——藥方、舊記，還有不知從哪兒換來的[em2]武學秘笈[/em2]……」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      42
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 42,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「大叔行走江湖，包袱裡的寶貝比藥箱還沉吧？小犀在客棧做小棧生意——您若有用不著的[em2]秘笈[/em2]，托小犀過手標價，賣了再分您。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Surprise_2);",
    "links": [
      43
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 43,
    "actorID": "role113",
    "text": "「通路商？成。挑幾本……咳，幾本[em2]不礙我修行[/em2]的，交你們過手試賣。別亂標價。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      44
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 44,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「口碑比暴利長久！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      45
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 45,
    "actorID": "role113",
    "text": "「……這句是我該說的吧？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      46
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 46,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（日落，客棧房間。床腳堆了從村民手中收來的貨；帳冊上寫滿品名與價錢。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      47
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 47,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "「茶博士的面具、書生的書、大叔的秘笈……[em2]小犀小棧[/em2]，開張啦！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Surprise_2);",
    "links": [
      48
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 48,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（她把帳冊往你手裡一塞，又指了指那幾冊秘笈，眼睛亮晶晶的。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      49
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 49,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「表哥，以後想買什麼，在房裡跟小犀說就行——不用滿村跑。等到了[em2]雲中[/em2]，好貨更多，人家再請行商托貨，小棧還能擴！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      50
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 50,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……所以我是掌櫃，還是腳夫？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=6);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      51
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 51,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「掌櫃！工錢兩文！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      52
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 52,
    "actorID": "NPC12",
    "text": "[panel=2]「兩位……咱這是客棧，不是貨棧啊。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      53
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 53,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「小二哥放心，不佔走道！過路客要買，還得先問小犀呢。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      54
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 54,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "解鎖根據地「小犀小棧」——可購買小溪村貨品",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      55
    ],
    "Description": "任務觸發節點：解鎖小犀小棧（小溪村）"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 55,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（馬車鈴聲仍未響起。可這個等不起來的小姑娘，已在客棧房裡搭好了第一個據點——等著把這條路，一路拓到雲中去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      56
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 56,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（英豪客棧的房間比小溪村寬敞些，可小犀第一件事仍是把帳冊攤開，在扉頁補了兩個字——[em2]雲中[/em2]。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      57
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 57,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「表哥，小溪村的小棧開張了，雲中這麼多過路客，不擴張太可惜啦！走，去談生意！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Surprise_2);",
    "links": [
      58
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 58,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「妳這掌櫃當上癮了是吧……」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=6);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      59
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 59,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「掌櫃才賺錢呢！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 60,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（巷子中。來自波斯的商人阿莎在攤位旁拴著一峰駱駝，毛色油亮；攤上還掛了件[em2]貂裘[/em2]，在雲中的山風裡格外扎眼。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      61
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 61,
    "actorID": "MC19",
    "text": "[panel=1]「喲，小妹妹又來啦。這回不是只看琉璃珠了吧？」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 62,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「阿莎姐姐，小犀在英豪客棧開了間小棧，專做買賣。您西域商道上來回，[em2]貂裘[/em2]、駱駝絨、那些中原見不著的稀罕物……與其壓在商隊裡，不如托小犀代發幾件？雲中江湖人，最愛買『別處沒有』的。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC8,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(2,MC8,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      63
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 63,
    "actorID": "MC19",
    "text": "[panel=1]「小掌櫃，嘴倒是甜。成，貂裘和幾樣西域稀罕貨，先交你過手。賣了二八分——我八，你二。駱駝嘛……」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(2);",
    "links": [
      64
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 64,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（她拍了拍駱駝的頸毛。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      65
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 65,
    "actorID": "MC19",
    "text": "[panel=1]「畜生哪能住客棧。絨與駝鈴、鞍辦小件，倒可以記在你帳上發賣。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      66
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 66,
    "actorID": "MC8",
    "text": "[panel=2]「駱駝絨、駝鈴……入帳！」",
